or the arrival of the 3rd Battalion, Royal Australian Regiment; and (b) congratulates Townsville Enterprise Pty Ltd on its pivotal role in encouraging and facilitating continued investment in north Queensland. Bob Brown I seek leave to make an amendment to the motion. Leave granted. I move: Omit paragraph (b), substitute: (b) congratulates Townsville Enterprise on its role in reducing housing supply pressures in Townsville through the redevelopment of the Lavarack Barracks and notes that the redevelopment was partially funded by the Labor government in the 2011-2012 Federal Budget. Question put: The Senate divided. [12.02] (The President—Senator the Hon. JJ Hogg) _Senator Chris Evans did not vote, to compensate for the vacancy caused by the resignation of Senator Coonan._ Question agreed to. John Hogg The question now is that Senator Macdonald's motion, as amended, be agreed to.","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-2054","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2011-08-25/1"}
